Z||000000||Steven||06-16-2001||11:49 PM||||Well it is fathers day now, and the fiero just made it back home after sending forever at the father-in-law's house building the engine. Anyways my wife gave me a bra for the Fiero, and she got it from the FieroStore, but it did not come with any directions as to how to attach it to the car. Could someone please tell me how this thing goes on? TIA!||||reg||5
Z||000001||Steven||06-17-2001||10:31 AM||||Bump||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fast Richard||06-17-2001||11:20 AM||||I bought a Wolf bra for my son's 86 SE and was so disgusted with the mounting system that I didn't even install it. You have to remove the screws from the fender liners, then there are some straps on the ends that you bend around the wheel opening of the fender. Then you have to try to screw the fender liner back on and make it look good. Can't be done! The instructions that come with it are generic crap. I'm still trying to find a way to install it, because other than the mounting, it looks like a pretty good bra.||||reg||8
Z||000003||CoolBlue87GT||06-17-2001||02:39 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fast Richard:<BR>[B]Then you have to try to screw the fender liner back on and make it look good. Can't be done! The instructions that come with it are generic crap. B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The instructions do say something about the screws, but in real life,  we didn't need to do that at all.  At first, I thought the same, but worked out great.<P>The one I have, the bottom part with the covered metal tabs get tucked up under the black spoiler,<BR>and the bungie w/clips gets hooked to a hole that is 1 in long by half inch wide located on the frame.<P>If you look w/ flashlight, you will see the hole. <P>I've got the instruction sheet, will e-mail it to you.<P>I let mine sit in the sun first, it streches better that way. The first time, it took <BR>two of us to get it lined up and tabs set just right. <P>Once set, on & off is quick. Make sure the bumber is clean & back of bra is clean.<BR>Would hate to hear of any damage done.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Del3more.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/del1more.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/del2more.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/CoolBlue87GT.gif"> ||||reg||1
